  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">영어에 관한 짧은 이야기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(1) -</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">처음 샌마커스에 왔을 때 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">HEB</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라는 마트에서 한국인 아줌마를 만났다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그녀는 여기 와서 우리가 만난 최초의 한국인이었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미국에 온지는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">16</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 되었다고 했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 분은 우리말을 하기는 하는데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일단 발음이 많이 이상했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그러면서 하시는 말씀 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내가 한국말을 빨리 못해요</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.”</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내게는 이곳에 사는 지인들 세 명이 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">둘은 대학동창</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하나는 고등학교 후배이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그들이 미국에서 산 기간은 둘은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">13</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년이고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하나는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그들은 우리말을 아주 잘한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 6</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년된 친구는 그렇다고 하고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 13</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 된 사람들한테 영어하고 한국어하고 어느 것이 편하냐고 물어보면 두 사람 다 영어와 우리말이 비슷하다고 했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">지난번에 만난 신부님도 미국에 온지 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">13</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 되었다고 했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리말 아주 잘 하신다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그러면서 하시는 말씀</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. “</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">박찬호는 여기 온지 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">개월 만에 혀가 꼬부라졌더라구요</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">신기하죠</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">원래 혀가 잘 안 꼬부라지거든요</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.”</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">지금 우리 학교 어학원에서 영어 가르치는 한국인 선생님께 이런 현상에 대해 물었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 분은 한국에서 대학을 졸업하고 미국에는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">TESOL</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">을 하러 왔다가 눌러 앉아 박사과정까지 마치고 지금은 교수는 아니지만 텍사스주립대에서 강의한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미국에 온 지는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 되었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미국에서 생활하면서 한국말을 전혀 사용하지 않고 몇년 살면 우리말을 잊게 되나요</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?”</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">물론 예시자료로 앞서 이야기한 마트아줌마와 내가 아는 사람들</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그리고 박찬호를 들었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">선생님의 대답</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그런 일은 일어나지 않습니다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.”</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그러면서 하시는 말씀이 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">살 이하의 어린 나이에 왔다면 모를까 한국에서 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">40</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 이상을 살다 온 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Mr. Lee</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">에게는 죽을 때까지 그런 일이 일어나지 않는다고 했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그러면서 몇 년 유학한 다음에 한국에 돌아가서 혀 꼬부라진 소리를 내는 사람들은 일부러 그러는 것이 아닐까 생각한다고 했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그리고 위에서 말한 마트 아줌마의 경우는 그 분이 원해 한국말을 빨리 못하는 사람이었거나 배움이 짧았을 가능성이 있다고 했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">한국에서 학교 많이 안 다닌 사람이 여기에 오면 한국말을 쉽게 잊는다고 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">영어에 관한 짧은 이야기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(2) -</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">도대체 영어를 잘 한다는 것이 무엇인가</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">영어를 논하기 이전에 한국어를 논해보자</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교에서 아이들을 가르치다 보면 우리말을 얼마나 잘 하는지 선생님이 야단이라도 치면 한 마디도 안지고 대꾸하는 애들이 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이런 애들은 말을 너무 잘해서 수업시간에도 자기들끼리 대화한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그런데 모의고사를 보면 수능 언어영역에서 반타작도 못한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그럼 이런 애들은 한국말을 잘하는 거냐</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아니냐</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하하하</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">언어에는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">개의 영역이 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">읽기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">쓰기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">듣기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">말하기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그런데 이 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">개의 영역은 읽기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">쓰기와 듣기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">말하기로 다시 구분된다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이유는 둘의 성격이 다르기 때문이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">듣기와 말하기는 현지에서 오래 살기만 하면 누구나가 터득하게 되는 영역이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">영어로 예를 들면 심지어 알파벳을 몰라도 가능하다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그러나 읽기와 쓰기는 그렇지가 않다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">저것은 배움을 통해서 길러지는 능력이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">공부를 못하는 애들의 첫 번째 증상은 책을 제대로 읽지 못한다는 것이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">믿어지지 않겠지만 고등학생들도 그렇다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">물론 그들은 한글을 모두 깨우쳤다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하지만 그들이 책 읽는 것을 듣고 있으면</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그것은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">읽는다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">고 말하기가 좀 곤란하다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그들은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">글</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">을 읽지 않고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, ‘</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">글자</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">를 읽는다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">물론 읽고 나서도 자신이 무엇을 읽었는지 조차 제대로 모른다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이들은 당연히 쓰기도 못한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">자신의 생각으로 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">A4</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">종이 한 장을 못 채운다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">머리에 든 것이 없다보니 글도 나오지 않는 거다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사족</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나한테 말씀해 준 한국인 선생님은 미국에서 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 살았고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">영어 전공해서 박사학위까지 받았으니 믿을만한 전문가의 견해라고 할 수 있겠다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 선생님은 방학 때 한국에 오면 사람들을 만나서 이야기할 때 의식적으로 영어단어는 사용하지 않고 말한다고 했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하긴 제대로 된 문장도 아니고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리말에 영어단어를 넣어서 말하는 사람들을 보면 내 눈에도 천박해 보인다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그리고 기본적으로 영어는 우리말을 할 수 없는 외국인들과 의사소통할 때 사용하는 수단이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">가끔 자국민들 앞에서 자기 외국어 실력을 자랑하는 사람들을 보면 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">빈수레가 요란하다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">는 속담이 떠오를 뿐이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
